      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        2
      ],
      "blind_answer": 2,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "n = 9/180 = 0.05 mol. m = 0.05/0.250 kg = 0.20 mol/kg."
    },
    {
      "q_id": "neet_che_u05_t00_3",
      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        3
      ],
      "blind_answer": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Take 1 L of solution: mass = 1160 g. Solute = 2 x 180 = 360 g, so solvent = 800 g. m = 2/0.8 = 2.5 mol/kg."
    },
    {
      "q_id": "neet_che_u05_t00_4",
      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        2
      ],
      "blind_answer": 2,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "A is true because molality is mass-based and does not depend on temperature. R is true, since x1 + x2 = 1. R does not explain A."
    },
    {
      "q_id": "neet_che_u05_t00_5",
      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        1
      ],
      "blind_answer": 1,
      "confidence": "medium",
      "blind_working": "I: converting molarity to molality needs the mass of solution, so density is required; I is correct. II: ppm (mass basis) and mass % are mass/mass, so temperature-independent. Volume % and mass/volume % involve volume, so they change; II is intended correct."
    },
    {
      "q_id": "neet_che_u05_t01_1",
      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        3
      ],
      "blind_answer": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Vapour pressure is an intensive equilibrium property. It depends only on the nature of the liquid and the temperature, not on the amount of liquid or the container size."
    },
    {
      "q_id": "neet_che_u05_t01_2",
      "published": true,
      "reason": null,
      "manual_approved": false,
      "our_answer": [
        1
      ],
      "blind_answer": 1,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "x_B = 0.75. p_total = 120(0.25) + 40(0.75) = 30 + 30 = 60 mm Hg."
    },
    {
      "q_id": "neet_che_u05_t01_3",
