      "blind_answer": 3,
      "confidence": "high",
      "blind_working": "Raoult's law gives p_total = p_A0 + (p_B0 - p_A0)x_B. This is linear in x_B, so the plot is a straight line joining p_A0 and p_B0."
    },
    {
